  "title": "悟性学习打坐套",
  "html": "<h3 class=\"ws-h2\">装备</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">替换路线（从左往右替换）（自制主要指有练习效率/学习效率的橙自制）</p><div class=\"ws-embed\"><span class=\"ws-embed-icon\">📊</span><span>在线表格</span><a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/CXv3wGosHiNTe3kywG0cFjKNnYc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在飞书中查看</a></div><div class=\"ws-grid\"><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/RMCLbaMASoWEb4xYHVKcflpAn9e.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"385\" height=\"468\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">有梅庄套后的搭配</p></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/CseybpPAZoEryEx7QGncnejdn7X.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"266\" height=\"421\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">有自制之后的搭配</p></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"></div></div><h3 class=\"ws-h2\">武功</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">拳脚：参合指，黯然销魂掌</p><p class=\"ws-p\">内功：清心咒，神照经（特殊进阶悟性），战神图录</p><p class=\"ws-p\">轻功：天南步，灵犀步</p><p class=\"ws-p\">招架：太极真义（武当）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">剑法：全真剑法，太极剑法（武当）（太极剑法无需装备为剑法即可增加悟性，因此武当练功剑法依然装备全真剑法）</p><h3 class=\"ws-h2\">装备</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">替换路线（从左往右替换）（自制主要指有练习效率/学习效率的自制）。</p><div class=\"ws-embed\"><span class=\"ws-embed-icon\">📊</span><span>在线表格</span><a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/CXv3wGosHiNTe3kywG0cFjKNnYc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在飞书中查看</a></div><div class=\"ws-grid\"><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/BVqRbMF6woNMqox3xEXcxhrDnSb.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"411\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">有梅庄套后的搭配</p></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"><figure class=\"ws-figure\"><img src=\"assets/YzOAbZR6xo9bjnxIcXycFzSEnec.png\" alt=\"攻略配图\" width=\"257\" height=\"385\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p class=\"ws-p\">自制</p></div><div class=\"ws-col\" style=\"flex:33 1 0\"></div></div><h3 class=\"ws-h2\">武功</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">拳脚：参合指，黯然销魂掌</p><p class=\"ws-p\">内功：清心咒，神照经（特殊进阶悟性），战神图录</p><p class=\"ws-p\">轻功：天南步，灵犀步</p><p class=\"ws-p\">招架：太极真义（武当）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">剑法：全真剑法，太极剑法（武当）（太极剑法无需装备为剑法即可增加悟性，因此武当练功剑法依然装备全真剑法）</p><h3 class=\"ws-h2\">装备</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">替换路线（从左往右替换）。</p><div class=\"ws-embed\"><span class=\"ws-embed-icon\">📊</span><span>在线表格</span><a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/CXv3wGosHiNTe3kywG0cFjKNnYc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">在飞书中查看</a></div><h3 class=\"ws-h2\">武功</h3><p class=\"ws-p\">读书写字：橙见禅心*1+古墓寒玉床（橙读书&lt;2000级）/橙见禅心*2+古墓寒玉床（橙读书&lt;2700级）/橙齐逍遥+豪宅练功房+与随从双修（橙读书大于上述条件的等级时）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">武帝前：</p><p class=\"ws-p\">拳脚：神照经（内功御气）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">内功：门派橙内/门派紫内（特殊进阶内力），镇岳诀（特殊进阶内力*2）/圣火神功（特殊进阶内力*2），玉女心经（特殊进阶内力*2）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">轻功：明玉功（内功御气）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">武帝后：</p><p class=\"ws-p\">拳脚、内功、轻功：同上</p><p class=\"ws-p\">招架：北冥神功（逍遥）{内功御气}/太极拳（武当）、劈石破玉拳（华山）、九阴白骨爪（峨眉）、穿心掌（杀手）、鹰爪功/千蛛万毒手（少林、丐帮）{拳脚御气}</p><p class=\"ws-p\">剑法：衡山五神剑（招架御气）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">刀法：胡家刀法（招架御气）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">棍法：绝门棍（轻功御气）/中平枪法（招架御气）</p><p class=\"ws-p\">杖法：灵蛇杖法/蛇岛奇功（招架御气）</p><p class=\"ws-source\">内容整理自飞书《武神MUD2手册》· <a href=\"https://ucn595zz2fou.feishu.cn/wiki/CXv3wGosHiNTe3kywG0cFjKNnYc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">查看原文</a></p>",
